{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf8i1b43hVKwJxuuF74zC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass successfully. Here's a summary of the implementation:\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfilment**\n- Added `quantity` field to Order and Shipment (default 1, validates positive integers)\n- Added DELIVERED status to ShipmentStatus enum\n- Created FulfilmentStatus model tracking allocated/delivered quantities and status (UNALLOCATED, PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED, FULLY_ALLOCATED, DELIVERED)\n- Added shipment transitions:\n  - POST `/shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` (CREATED → CONFIRMED)\n  - POST `/shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver` (CONFIRMED → DELIVERED)\n  - POST `/shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel` (CREATED → CANCELLED)\n- Implemented quantity allocation validation (HTTP 409 when shipment exceeds order quantity)\n- Shipment cancellation releases quantity, allowing re-allocation\n- GET /orders supports `?fulfilment=STATUS` filter\n\n### 2. **Customer Validation**\n- Orders now validate customer exists before creation (HTTP 422 via error envelope)\n- CustomerController.getById() now throws ResourceNotFoundException with error envelope instead of returning ResponseEntity.notFound()\n- Added CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND error code\n\n### 3. **Paged Lists**\n- All list endpoints (GET /customers, GET /orders, GET /shipments) support:\n  - `limit` parameter (1-100, default 100)\n  - `offset` parameter (0+, default 0)\n  - `X-Total-Count` header with total count\n- Invalid parameters return HTTP 400 with validation error envelope\n- On GET /orders, total count reflects the fulfilment filter\n\n### Key Changes Made\n- Updated models: Order, Shipment, Customer (added quantity and fulfilment fields)\n- Updated controllers with pagination, validation, and transition endpoints\n- Updated repositories to support filtering and shipment lookups\n- Updated OrderControllerTest to create customers before orders\n- Updated CustomerControllerTest to verify error envelope\n- Added UnprocessableEntityException for 422 responses\n\n### Verification\n✅ Build passes  \n✅ All 13 tests pass  \n✅ No new Maven dependencies  \n✅ No unrelated file changes  \n✅ Error responses consistent with API envelope"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":218,"cache_read_input_tokens":65146,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":218},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"77a58924-786d-4452-9648-476d78eeb766","uuid":"af9d8161-1c00-4ec6-8e28-249b870ffdaf","timestamp":"2026-09-17T08:37:28.835Z","request_id":"req_011Cf8i1aGuej8rEbJXBNngo"}
